@startuml
' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Five lifelines with mixed state and value lanes, inter-lane constraints, multiple events and observations.
'   usecase:      Teach mixed robust/concise lanes, inter-lane constraints, time observation labels.
'   complexity:   complex
'   domain:       Embedded control system startup
' ============================================================================
title Example Timing Diagram - Complex System Startup

' `robust` lanes hold discrete states; `concise` lanes plot a continuous value.
robust  "Power"    as P
robust  "Boot"     as B
concise "Voltage"  as V
robust  "Sensor"   as SE
robust  "Watchdog" as W

@0
P is "Off"
B is "Reset"
V = 0
SE is "Cold"
W is "Halt"

@1
P is "On"
V = 3.0
@1.5
V = 3.3

@2
B is "ROM"
@3
B is "Bootloader"
@4
B is "OS"
@5
B is "App"

' Time observations label points reused by constraints.
@5 as :appReady
@6 as :sensorUp

SE is "Init"
:appReady - :sensorUp <= 2 s

@6
SE is "Calibrated"
W is "Idle"

@9
W is "Armed"

' Inter-lane constraint: watchdog cannot arm until the sensor is calibrated.
@6 as :cal
@9 as :armed
:cal - :armed >= 2 s

@14
P is "Off"
V = 0
B is "Reset"
SE is "Cold"
W is "Halt"

@enduml
